window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>She can fight all she wants. In the end, she'll still be screaming my name.</b></p> <p>I'm her best friend's older brother.</p> <p>When this feisty little thing pissed off a rival mob boss, I should have felt like a bastard for stripping her bare, spanking her ass red, and then teaching her how a good girl thanks a man like me for his protection.</p> <p>But she was soaking wet and ready for me when I bent her over and took her exactly the way she needed to be taken.</p> <p>Because whether she likes it or not, she's always been mine.</p> <p>And she always will be.</p> <p>Yours <i>is a stand-alone novel, which is the third book in Sara's bestselling series The Godfathers. For mature listeners.</i></p>"; 
